{"story_id":83239,"updated_at":"2026-11-19T00:41:51","headline_en":"SAFF Championship final: India defeats Pakistan 2-1 to claim record 10th title","headline_hi":"SAFF चैंपियनशिप फाइनल: भारत ने पाकिस्तान को 2-1 से हराकर रिकॉर्ड 10वां खिताब जीता","payload_en":{"story_id":83239,"headline":"SAFF Championship final: India defeats Pakistan 2-1 to claim record 10th title","counts":{"articles":17,"independent_sources":9,"outlets":10},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"interim","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["Aaj Tak","Al Jazeera","Dawn","Gulf News","Hindustan Times","National Herald","News18","Organiser","The Express Tribune","Times of India"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":83239,"parents":[],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-11-19T00:41:51","category":{"v":2,"primary":["india"],"secondary":["life"],"tertiary":["sport-films"]},"places":[],"people":["Pakistan","SAFF Championship","Junaid Shah","Sandip Mandi","Alamgir Ghazi","Naushad Moosa","Suhail Ahmad Bhat","Dhaka"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"On Tuesday, India defeated Pakistan 2-1 to win the SAFF Championship trophy.","ids":[146744],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2,3,4,5,6]},{"text":"The Indian football team defeated the Pakistan football team 2-1 in the SAFF Championship final in Dhaka.","ids":[146755],"class":"partial","sources":[7,8]},{"text":"This was Pakistan's first-ever SAFF Championship final appearance.","ids":[146754],"class":"unverified","sources":[2,4,8]}],[{"text":"Pakistan's Junaid Shah was sent off following a VAR review.","ids":[146770],"class":"unverified","sources":[3,8]},{"text":"Shah received a straight red card.","ids":[146774],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Shah was shown a red card in the 60th minute, updating an earlier report that it occurred in the 57th minute.","ids":[146749,146766],"class":"single","sources":[2,5]}],[{"text":"The Pakistan men's football team gave the Indian team a guard of honour after the SAFF Championship final.","ids":[146743],"class":"single","sources":[6]},{"text":"Players from both teams shook hands and exchanged high-fives during the medal ceremony.","ids":[146745],"class":"single","sources":[6]},{"text":"Pakistan's players gave the Indian team a guard of honour during the medal ceremony.","ids":[146769],"class":"single","sources":[3]},{"text":"The Indian and Pakistan football teams exchanged a guard of honour during the trophy presentation ceremony.","ids":[146756],"class":"single","sources":[7]}],[{"text":"Sandip Mandi scored a winning goal for India.","ids":[146776],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Mandi scored a goal for India in the 88th minute.","ids":[146751],"class":"unverified","sources":[2,3,4,8]},{"text":"Mandi scored a goal in the 87th minute.","ids":[146764],"class":"single","sources":[5]},{"text":"Suhail Ahmad Bhat scored a goal for India in the 58th minute.","ids":[146767],"class":"single","sources":[5]}],[{"text":"Alamgir Ghazi scored a goal for Pakistan in first-half stoppage time.","ids":[146748],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2,3,5]},{"text":"Ghazi gave Pakistan the lead in first-half stoppage time.","ids":[146761],"class":"single","sources":[4]}],[{"text":"India competed in the 2026 SAFF Championship with a second-string squad of younger players under U-23 coach Naushad Moosa.","ids":[146746],"class":"single","sources":[6]},{"text":"Bhat was named the Most Valuable Player of the SAFF 2026 tournament.","ids":[146759],"class":"single","sources":[7]}],[{"text":"Moosa said, \"If needed, we would love to go and hug them\".","ids":[146758],"class":"single","sources":[7]}],[{"text":"The Indian football team extended their SAFF Championship title streak to three consecutive editions.","ids":[146757],"class":"single","sources":[7]},{"text":"More than 10,000 fans watched the match [the South Asian Football Federation (SAFF) Championship].","ids":[146777],"class":"single","sources":[1]}]],"section_keys":["news","happened","happened","happened","happened","happened","say","numbers"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://www.aljazeera.com/gallery/2026/11/18/photos-india-defeat-pakistan-to-win-saff-championship-in-bangladesh?traffic_source=rss","outlet":"Al Jazeera","title":"Photos: India defeat Pakistan to win SAFF Championship in Bangladesh","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"url":"https://www.dawn.com/news/2045209/pakistan-fall-to-india-in-saff-final-after-late-heartbreak","outlet":"Dawn","title":"Pakistan fall to India in SAFF final after late heartbreak","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":3,"url":"https://gulfnews.com/sport/football/unlike-cricket-pakistan-show-remarkable-sportsmanship-with-guard-of-honour-for-india-after-heartbreaking-saff-defeat-1.500751269","outlet":"Gulf News","title":"Unlike cricket, Pakistan show remarkable sportsmanship with guard of honour for India after heartbreaking SAFF defeat","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":4,"url":"https://www.news18.com/sports/football/india-thumps-pakistan-2-1-to-claim-10th-saff-championship-title-ws-l-10429906.html","outlet":"News18","title":"India Thumps Pakistan 2-1 To Claim 10th SAFF Championship Title","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":5,"url":"https://tribune.com.pk/story/2640846/india-clinch-record-tenth-saff-cup-title","outlet":"The Express Tribune","title":"India clinch record tenth SAFF Cup title","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":6,"url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/football/top-stories/high-fives-pakistan-give-india-guard-of-honour-after-saff-final-watch/articleshow/135948448.cms","outlet":"Times of India","title":"High-fives! Pakistan give India guard of honour after SAFF final - Watch","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":7,"url":"https://www.nationalheraldindia.com/football/saff-football-india-pakistan-bring-back-grace-with-guard-of-honour-after-final","outlet":"National Herald","title":"SAFF football: India, Pakistan bring back grace with